{\an8}d And this road that you choose,
there's a long way left to go d


01:44:42.819 --> 01:44:47.495
{\an8}d And you'll never get
to where you want to be, d


01:44:47.615 --> 01:44:50.576
{\an8}d at least not with me d


01:45:24.694 --> 01:45:27.285
{\an8}d There's a place
